  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Global id&#xe9; CSO strategi 2025-2029</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global id&#xe9; CSO strategy 2025-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmets &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla att &#xf6;verlevare f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttskr&#xe4;nkningar p&#xe5; grund av oljefynd i Sudan (numera Sydsudan) fullt ut kan kr&#xe4;va sin r&#xe4;tt till uppr&#xe4;ttelse och ers&#xe4;ttning enligt internationella principer. Programmet innefattar vidaref&#xf6;rmedling till tv&#xe5; civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer i Sydsudan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the programme is to ensure that survivors of human rights violations caused by oil discoveries in Sudan (now South Sudan) can fully claim their right to justice and compensation in accordance with international principles. The programme includes the disbursement of funds to two civil society organisations in South Sudan.</narrative>
  </description>
